00:14:29.734 --> 00:14:32.527
Why can't we make things happen now?

00:14:32.527 --> 00:14:34.110
What is our excuse?

00:14:35.193 --> 00:14:38.710
Why should anybody be
uneducated in this planet?

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.122
