00:15:32.516 --> 00:15:36.109
- Like I explained to
young people in Bangladesh

00:15:36.109 --> 00:15:38.786
in a language that
probably they understand.

00:15:38.786 --> 00:15:40.795
I said, why should you go for a job?

00:15:40.795 --> 00:15:43.824
Because if you take a job,
you start at the bottom.

00:15:43.824 --> 00:15:45.365
Nobody will give you a top job

00:15:45.365 --> 00:15:47.043
when you first time you get...

00:15:47.043 --> 00:15:50.468
So, you take orders
from your immediate boss

00:15:50.468 --> 00:15:52.962
and then there's a series
of bosses on top of it.

00:15:52.962 --> 00:15:55.978
So, all your life is trying
to satisfy your boss.

00:15:55.978 --> 00:15:58.352
All your creative power you sacrifice it.

00:15:58.352 --> 00:16:00.822
Why should you sacrifice
your creative power?

00:16:00.822 --> 00:16:03.393
I said, if you're going
the entrepreneurial path,

00:16:03.393 --> 00:16:04.900
you want to become entrepreneur,

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.978
you always start at the top
because you are the boss.

00:16:07.978 --> 00:16:09.271
You are the one who decide.

00:16:09.271 --> 00:16:13.253
You create, you bring all
your creative resources

00:16:13.253 --> 00:16:16.472
into the picture, all your
creative capacity in the picture.

00:16:16.472 --> 00:16:19.351
So, today we sacrifice
ourselves that we don't

00:16:19.351 --> 00:16:21.144
bring our creative power because

00:16:21.144 --> 00:16:22.711
of the system of taking jobs.

